/div>\n                      </div>\n      </div>\n\n                                </div>\n                                                </div>","blocksHtml":"<div class=\"product-blocks blocks-default\">\n            <div class=\"product-blocks-default product-blocks-416 grid-rows\">\n          <div class=\"grid-row grid-row-416-1\">\n                <div class=\"grid-cols\">\n                      <div class=\"grid-col grid-col-416-1-1\">\n              <div class=\"grid-items\">\n                                  <div class=\"grid-item grid-item-416-1-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"module module-blocks module-blocks-417 blocks-tabs\">\n    <div class=\"module-body\">\n                <div class=\"tabs-container\">\n      <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\">\n                  <li class=\"tab-2 active\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Description</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-4\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Product Table</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-5\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Video</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-6\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-4\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Review</a>\n                      </li>\n              </ul>\n      <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                              <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane active\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <p></p><h2>Netgear Orbi RBK352 WiFi 6 AX1800 Dual Band Mesh System</h2>Upgrade your home network with the Netgear Orbi RBK352 WiFi 6 Mesh System. Designed to provide seamless, high-speed coverage for homes up to 3,500 sq. ft., the Orbi RBK352 delivers ultra-fast internet speeds with WiFi 6 technology. Enjoy improved device capacity, greater efficiency, and less network congestion, making it perfect for households with multiple smart devices.<p></p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li>WiFi 6 Technology: Experience faster speeds, increased capacity, and improved efficiency for modern devices.</li><li>AX1800 Dual Band: Delivers up to 600 Mbps on 2.4GHz and 1200 Mbps on 5GHz for seamless HD streaming and gaming.</li><li>Mesh Network Coverage: Eliminate dead zones and enjoy reliable coverage throughout your home.</li><li>Gigabit Ethernet Ports: Equipped with 4 LAN ports on the router and 2 LAN ports on each satellite for high-speed wired connections.</li><li>Support for Multiple Devices: Connect up to 25 devices simultaneously, making it ideal for busy homes and small businesses.</li><li>Advanced Security: Protect your network with 128-bit AES encryption and secure WiFi protocols.</li><li>Easy Setup &amp; Management: Set up and manage your WiFi network using the Orbi app or web interface.</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Perfect for streaming, gaming, working from home, and managing multiple smart devices, the Netgear Orbi RBK352 offers an ideal solution for fast, reliable, and secure WiFi. Whether you’re in a medium or large-sized home, this mesh system ensures you have the connectivity you need to stay connected.</p>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n       